{
  "name": "Go Live Notify",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## go-live-notify\n\nTriggered by MediaMTX's `runOnReady` hook (see `n8n/mediamtx/mediamtx.yml`) the instant OBS/Restream starts publishing to the EC2 RTMP server — fires for every real stream start, no manual step needed.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Webhook receives `{ event: 'stream_started', path: 'live' }`\n2. Validates `X-N8N-Webhook-Secret` header\n3. Resolves the go-live asset (a 5-second vertical mp4 hosted on `cdn.stpetemusic.live`) + the public link (`stpetemusic.live/live`)\n4. Fans out in parallel: Facebook Page feed video post, Facebook Video Story, Instagram Video Story (link sticker) — each fails independently (`continueOnFail`) so one platform outage doesn't block the others\n\n**Facebook Video Story protocol (confirmed against Meta's docs, 2026-06-22):** NOT the same resumable upload as the regular `/videos` endpoint. It's `/video_stories` with `upload_phase=start` (returns `video_id` + `upload_url`) → POST to that `upload_url` with header `Authorization: OAuth {token}` and header `file_url: {cdn url}` (Facebook fetches the video itself, no binary transfer through n8n needed) → wait → `/video_stories` with `upload_phase=finish` + `video_id` to publish. The earlier version of this workflow incorrectly reused the simple `/videos` file_url method and got `(#100) The parameter upload_phase is required`.\n\n**Required env vars (set in n8n .env):**\n- `N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET` — shared secret, must match the value deploy.yml substitutes into mediamtx.yml\n- `GO_LIVE_ASSET_URL` — public CDN URL of the 5s mp4; swap this to change the video without touching the workflow\n- `GO_LIVE_LINK_URL` — defaults to https://www.stpetemusic.live/live\n- `FB_PAGE_ID` / `FB_ACCESS_TOKEN`, `IG_USER_ID` / `IG_ACCESS_TOKEN` — already configured\n\n**Not built yet (deferred, see plan):**\n- Threads branch — needs a separate Meta API app product + `THREADS_USER_ID` / `THREADS_ACCESS_TOKEN`\n- Facebook Group posting — dropped, `publish_to_groups` isn't realistically obtainable for this app\n\n**Still unverified:** whether the `link` param on the FB Story `finish` call actually attaches a CTA/link sticker — Meta's own docs don't document this parameter for video stories (per Ayrshare's writeup, which covers only the happy path). If it's silently ignored, that's a known gap, not a bug.\n\n**IG Story retry loop (confirmed working via live test, 2026-06-22):** Instagram's video processing for this 5s clip took longer than both a 15s and a flat 30s wait — `Check IG Status` → `Is IG Ready?` now loops back through `IG Retry Wait` (30s) → `Check IG Status` again indefinitely until `status_code: FINISHED`, mirroring the same indefinite retry shape already proven in `obsidian-to-youtube-posting.json`'s Reels flow.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [240, -380],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Threads — planned, not built**\n\nWhen ready: add a branch here mirroring the FB Page Feed post —\n`POST /{THREADS_USER_ID}/threads` (create container) → `POST /{THREADS_USER_ID}/threads_publish`.\n\nNeeds a separate \"Threads API\" app product registered in the Meta App Dashboard (distinct from the standard Graph API app already used for FB/IG) plus new env vars `THREADS_USER_ID` / `THREADS_ACCESS_TOKEN`.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [1300, 900],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Sticky Note (Threads — future)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "go-live",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook: Go Live",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 260],
      "webhookId": "go-live"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Validate the shared secret sent by MediaMTX's runOnReady hook (and any other caller).\n// Header lookup is case-insensitive since n8n's webhook node may not normalize keys.\nconst raw = $input.first().json;\nconst headers = raw.headers || {};\nconst headerKey = Object.keys(headers).find((k) => k.toLowerCase() === 'x-n8n-webhook-secret');\nconst provided = headerKey ? headers[headerKey] : undefined;\nconst expected = $env.N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET;\n\nif (!expected || provided !== expected) {\n  throw new Error('[go-live-notify] Invalid or missing X-N8N-Webhook-Secret header');\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: raw.body || raw }];"
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Verify Webhook Secret",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [500, 260]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Asset and link are env-driven on purpose — swapping the mp4 for a new cut later is a\n// config change (re-upload + update GO_LIVE_ASSET_URL), not a workflow edit.\nconst assetUrl = $env.GO_LIVE_ASSET_URL;\nconst linkUrl = $env.GO_LIVE_LINK_URL || 'https://www.stpetemusic.live/live';\n\nif (!assetUrl) {\n  throw new Error('[go-live-notify] GO_LIVE_ASSET_URL is not set');\n}\n\nconst caption = \"We're live right now! Watch at \" + linkUrl;\n\nreturn [{ json: { assetUrl, linkUrl, caption } }];"
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Resolve Asset and Link",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [760, 260]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'https://graph.facebook.com/v24.0/' + $env.FB_PAGE_ID + '/videos' }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "file_url", "value": "={{ $json.assetUrl }}" },
            { "name": "description", "value": "={{ $json.caption }}" },
            { "name": "access_token", "value": "={{ $env.FB_ACCESS_TOKEN }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Post to FB Page Feed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [1020, 60],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'https://graph.facebook.com/v24.0/' + $env.FB_PAGE_ID + '/video_stories' }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "upload_phase", "value": "start" },
            { "name": "access_token", "value": "={{ $env.FB_ACCESS_TOKEN }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "FB Story: Start Upload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [1020, 280],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.upload_url }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "={{ 'OAuth ' + $env.FB_ACCESS_TOKEN }}" },
            { "name": "file_url", "value": "={{ $('Resolve Asset and Link').item.json.assetUrl }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000015",
      "name": "FB Story: Upload Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [1280, 280],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 20
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Wait for FB Story Upload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1540, 280],
      "webhookId": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000012"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'https://graph.facebook.com/v24.0/' + $env.FB_PAGE_ID + '/video_stories' }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "upload_phase", "value": "finish" },
            { "name": "video_id", "value": "={{ $('FB Story: Start Upload').item.json.video_id }}" },
            { "name": "link", "value": "={{ $('Resolve Asset and Link').item.json.linkUrl }}" },
            { "name": "access_token", "value": "={{ $env.FB_ACCESS_TOKEN }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "FB Story: Finish & Publish",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [1800, 280],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'https://graph.facebook.com/v24.0/' + $env.IG_USER_ID + '/media' }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "media_type", "value": "STORIES" },
            { "name": "video_url", "value": "={{ $json.assetUrl }}" },
            { "name": "link", "value": "={{ $json.linkUrl }}" },
            { "name": "access_token", "value": "={{ $env.IG_ACCESS_TOKEN }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Create IG Story Container",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [1020, 520],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 30
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Wait for IG Story Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1280, 520],
      "webhookId": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000008"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ 'https://graph.facebook.com/v24.0/' + $('Create IG Story Container').item.json.id + '?fields=status_code,status&access_token=' + $env.IG_ACCESS_TOKEN }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Check IG Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [1540, 520],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "9c1f1a00-0000-4000-8000-00000000ig01",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status_code }}",
              "rightValue": "FINISHED",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "Is IG Ready?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1800, 520]
    },
    {
